###Block: Descriptions
Animate City.MOD	DESC:Buildings and structures attack your enemies; see text.
Charm Person (Mass).MOD	DESC:Like charm person, affects a number of creatures whose combined HD does not exceed twice your level.
Choose Destiny.MOD	DESC:During the spell, any time you make an attack roll, skill check, ability check or saving throw you may roll twice and select which die roll to use.
City Lights.MOD	DESC:Absorb all artificial light causing a flare; see text.
City Stride.MOD	DESC:Teleports you from one community to a second designated community; see text.
City's Might.MOD	DESC:Gain Strength and Constitution from the living city; see text.
Commune with City.MOD	DESC:Gain three factual knowledges from the surrounding area; see text.
Discern Bloodline.MOD	DESC:Know race and templates of target.
Friendly Face.MOD	DESC:Grants +5 circumstance bonus on Diplomacy and Gather Information checks.
Insignia of Alarm.MOD	DESC:Spell alerts all wearers.
Insignia of Blessing.MOD	DESC:+1 morale bonus on attack rolls and on saving throws against fear effects.
Insignia of Healing.MOD	DESC:Heals 1d8+(min(CASTERLEVEL,10)) to all wearers.
Insignia of Warding.MOD	DESC:+1 divine bonus to AC and on Fort saves.
Locate City.MOD	DESC:Sense the distance of your nearest community of minimum size you designate.
Phantom Guardians.MOD	DESC:Creates minor image of small or medium creature who follow a brief set of commands.
Proud Arrogance.MOD	DESC:Grants +4 save against charm, compulsion and fear effects. Only works on same race.
Rooftop Strider.MOD	DESC:Gain +5 competence bonus to Balance and Jump checks.
Scholar's Touch.MOD	DESC:Absorb the contents of an entire book as if you had read it once. Not perfect recall and must be able to read the language.
Shadow Guardians.MOD	DESC:As phantom guardians only more substantial and able to attack.
Skyline Runner.MOD	DESC:You can walk on any city surface as if it were level ground, including vertical walls, windows and clothes-drying lines.
Unseen Servant (Mass).MOD	DESC:Same as unseen servant, only it creates multiple servants.
Urban Shield.MOD	DESC:City shields you, granting a +4 AC bonus and +2 Reflex saves against all attacks and spells.
Warp Destiny.MOD	DESC:Gain an insight bonus (min(CASTERLEVEL,20)) to reshape your fate; see text.
Winding Alleys.MOD	DESC:Target feels as if the walls are closing in on him.
